[
 {
  "text": "Oregon once tried to make a dead whale disappear.",
  "s": 0.15,
  "e": 2.501
 },
 {
  "text": "Instead, they made it rain whale.",
  "s": 2.573,
  "e": 3.935
 },
 {
  "text": "November, nineteen seventy.",
  "s": 4.145,
  "e": 5.581
 },
 {
  "text": "A forty-five-foot sperm whale washes up on the beach at Florence.",
  "s": 5.641,
  "e": 8.94
 },
 {
  "text": "Eight tons.",
  "s": 9.012,
  "e": 9.666
 },
 {
  "text": "And it stinks.",
  "s": 9.726,
  "e": 10.372
 },
 {
  "text": "Bury it?",
  "s": 10.582,
  "e": 11.11
 },
 {
  "text": "The tide would dig it right back up.",
  "s": 11.14,
  "e": 12.549
 },
 {
  "text": "Tow it?",
  "s": 12.621,
  "e": 13.115
 },
 {
  "text": "Way too heavy.",
  "s": 13.145,
  "e": 13.915
 },
 {
  "text": "So the highway department has a better idea: blow it up.",
  "s": 14.005,
  "e": 16.871
 },
 {
  "text": "Tiny pieces, and the seagulls will clean up the rest.",
  "s": 16.943,
  "e": 19.526
 },
 {
  "text": "One man in the crowd, Walter Umenhofer, learned explosives in the army.",
  "s": 19.736,
  "e": 23.494
 },
 {
  "text": "He told them twenty sticks would do it.",
  "s": 23.566,
  "e": 25.074
 },
 {
  "text": "They brought twenty cases.",
  "s": 25.146,
  "e": 26.29
 },
 {
  "text": "Half a ton of dynamite.",
  "s": 26.35,
  "e": 27.496
 },
 {
  "text": "Crowds gather.",
  "s": 27.706,
  "e": 28.459
 },
 {
  "text": "Cameras roll.",
  "s": 28.507,
  "e": 29.233
 },
 {
  "text": "Three.",
  "s": 29.353,
  "e": 29.785
 },
 {
  "text": "Two.",
  "s": 29.905,
  "e": 30.299
 },
 {
  "text": "One.",
  "s": 30.419,
  "e": 30.779
 },
 {
  "text": "For one second, it's beautiful.",
  "s": 32.079,
  "e": 33.414
 },
 {
  "text": "Then the sky starts falling.",
  "s": 33.504,
  "e": 34.771
 },
 {
  "text": "Chunks of blubber rain on the crowd, on the dunes, all the way to the parking lot.",
  "s": 34.843,
  "e": 39.004
 },
 {
  "text": "Luckily, nobody was hurt.",
  "s": 39.214,
  "e": 40.471
 },
 {
  "text": "Unluckily, it was still raining whale.",
  "s": 40.591,
  "e": 42.339
 },
 {
  "text": "You see, a blast always goes where it's easiest.",
  "s": 42.579,
  "e": 44.812
 },
 {
  "text": "Step on a ketchup packet:",
  "s": 44.902,
  "e": 46.064
 },
 {
  "text": "the ketchup doesn't go into the floor.",
  "s": 46.112,
  "e": 47.749
 },
 {
  "text": "It shoots out sideways, straight at your friend.",
  "s": 47.809,
  "e": 49.881
 },
 {
  "text": "The packed sand wouldn't move, so all that force went the easy way.",
  "s": 50.001,
  "e": 53.163
 },
 {
  "text": "Up.",
  "s": 53.223,
  "e": 53.599
 },
 {
  "text": "And toward the people.",
  "s": 53.719,
  "e": 54.603
 },
 {
  "text": "And the seagulls?",
  "s": 54.843,
  "e": 55.615
 },
 {
  "text": "The boom scared every single one away.",
  "s": 55.687,
  "e": 57.421
 },
 {
  "text": "Most of the whale was still lying there.",
  "s": 57.493,
  "e": 59.069
 },
 {
  "text": "So the crew buried it anyway.",
  "s": 59.129,
  "e": 60.491
 },
 {
  "text": "And the one man who said, too much dynamite?",
  "s": 60.731,
  "e": 62.812
 },
 {
  "text": "The biggest chunk landed right on his car.",
  "s": 62.962,
  "e": 64.84
 }
]